<title>USA: NYSE says Oakley declines comment on shrs.</title>
<headline>NYSE says Oakley declines comment on shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Oakley Inc declined to comment on its share activity today after the exchange requested a statement about any developments that would account for the increase in its share price.</p>
<p>Oakley's shares surged 1-5/8 to close at 11-7/8 on 2,158,000 shares of volume.</p>
</text>
